de": 1, "id": 0}, {"id": 1, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn4le13ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I have one more question.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: How can I help you?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: What can you tell me about the Macy's Parade?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: Aahhh. This is an event you don't want to miss! It is a true New York staple!", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn4le13ob10re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>:  What is the Parade about?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: It celebrates the beginning of the festive season. People gather on the streets. They watch the massive balloons and floats go by.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Where does it start?", "id": 2, "time": "11000", "image": "engenn4le13ob10re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: It starts at the Museum of Natural History, on 77th Street. Then it goes along Central Park West. The parade continues all the way down on Broadway. It ends at Macy's, on 34th and 7th.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: When is it?", "id": 3, "time": "21000", "image": "engenn4le13ob10re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: It's on Thanksgiving Day! It celebrates this great American tradition.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ohh ... Thanksgiving at Macy's? I love shopping!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Concierge</span>: You should wait until Black Friday then!", "id": 4, "time": "35000", "image": "engenn4le13ob10re2img01.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn4le13ob10re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn4le13ob10re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}, {"id": 2, "title": "", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [], "audiosrc": "engenn4le13ob10re6aud01", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "pic